From e9900d527555ef9478ae32497b4668672ce3a810 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Multi-Zalo Build Engineering <build@multizalodesktop.local>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:06:49 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] build(msrv): align workspace rust-version to 1.90 (IR-001)

Align desktop-instance-manager/Cargo.toml rust-version with apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml (1.90) and refresh ADR-002 MSRV documentation.
---
 desktop-instance-manager/Cargo.toml                             | 2 +-
 .../docs/architecture/adr-002-rust-tauri-and-sac-host-bridge.md | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/desktop-instance-manager/Cargo.toml b/desktop-instance-manager/Cargo.toml
index 3103761..3f2a7d9 100644
--- a/desktop-instance-manager/Cargo.toml
+++ b/desktop-instance-manager/Cargo.toml
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ exclude = [
 [workspace.package]
 version = "0.1.0"
 edition = "2021"
-rust-version = "1.85"
+rust-version = "1.90"
 license = "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
 
 [workspace.dependencies]
diff --git a/desktop-instance-manager/docs/architecture/adr-002-rust-tauri-and-sac-host-bridge.md b/desktop-instance-manager/docs/architecture/adr-002-rust-tauri-and-sac-host-bridge.md
index 7002fec..f558f5f 100644
--- a/desktop-instance-manager/docs/architecture/adr-002-rust-tauri-and-sac-host-bridge.md
+++ b/desktop-instance-manager/docs/architecture/adr-002-rust-tauri-and-sac-host-bridge.md
@@ -34,7 +34,7 @@ Weights: SAC Compatibility Today (`25%`), Long-Term Cross-Platform Architecture
 We adopt a **dual-host execution architecture** sharing one canonical domain contract and one Modern Web UI:
 
 1. **Canonical Rust Workspace + Tauri 2 (`Cargo.toml`, `crates/*`, `apps/desktop/src-tauri/`):**
-   - Edition 2021, MSRV `1.78`, `license = "MIT OR Apache-2.0"`, strict workspace lints (`unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn = "deny"`, `clippy::unwrap_used = "warn"`, `clippy::expect_used = "warn"`).
+   - Edition 2021, MSRV `1.90`, `license = "MIT OR Apache-2.0"`, strict workspace lints (`unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn = "deny"`, `clippy::unwrap_used = "warn"`, `clippy::expect_used = "warn"`).
    - `deny.toml` enforces `rustls` (banning `openssl`/`openssl-sys`), permissive OSS licenses (`MIT`, `Apache-2.0`, `BSD-*`, `ISC`, `Zlib`, `Unicode-3.0`), crates.io-only sources, and advisory checks.
    - `apps/desktop/src-tauri/` wraps `dim-core`, `dim-profile-store`, `dim-process-manager`, and `dim-platform-*` into Tauri 2 IPC commands (`commands.rs`), compiled and tested on CI (`windows-latest`, `macos-latest`, `ubuntu-latest`).
 2. **Windows SAC Signed-Host Bridge (`scripts/dim-host.ps1` + `apps/desktop/ui-server.mjs`):**
